cess mode](https://nsis.sourceforge.io/Docs/Chapter3.html#usagereference), but ignores warnings (unless in strict mode).","order":6},"nsis.diagnostics.overrideCompression":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Overrides compression settings to speed up diagnostics","order":7},"nsis.diagnostics.excludedFiles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":[],"markdownDescription":"Specify files that will be excluded from diagnostics. Supports [glob patterns](https://github.com/micromatch/micromatch#matching-features).","order":8},"nsis.diagnostics.useCustomArguments":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Use custom compiler arguments in diagnostics mode. Enabling this will override the Diagnostics Custom Arguments option.","order":9},"nsis.diagnostics.customArguments":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":[],"markdownDescription":"Specify any of the default [compiler arguments](http://nsis.sourceforge.net/Docs/Chapter3.html#usage) for diagnostics mode.","order":10},"nsis.showNotifications":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Show build notifications indicating success or failure","order":11},"nsis.processHeaders":{"type":"string","enum":["Allow","Disallow","Disallow & Never Ask Me"],"enumDescriptions":["Compilation is enabled for both, .nsi and .nsh files","Compilation is enabled for .nsi files only, displays a warning when trying to compile .nsh files","Compilation is enabled for .nsi files only, no additional warnings are displayed"],"default":"Disallow","markdownDescription":"By default, only `.nsi` files will be compiled. This setting enables compilation for `.nsh` files as well.","order":12},"nsis.showOutputView":{"type":"string","enum":["Always","On Warnings & Errors","On Errors","Never"],"enumDescriptions":["The output panel is shown whenever a script is compiled","The output panel is only shown when the compiled script has warnings or errors","The output panel is only shown when the compiled script has error